@startuml
node "Dispositivo do Usuário" {
  component "Navegador Web\n(Browser)" as Browser
}

cloud "Vercel" {
  node "Frontend Server" {
    component "React SPA\n(Worky UI)" as ReactUI
  }
}

cloud "Render / VPS" {
  node "Backend Server" {
    component "FastAPI App" as FastAPI
    component "Playwright Scraper" as Scraper
    component "Modelos NLP" as IA
  }
}

cloud "Supabase Cloud" {
  database "PostgreSQL" as PG
  component "Auth Service" as Auth
}

Browser <--> ReactUI : HTTPS
ReactUI <--> FastAPI : API REST (JSON)
ReactUI <--> Auth : JWT Auth
FastAPI --> Scraper : Executa
FastAPI <--> IA : Processamento Local
FastAPI <--> PG : Leitura/Escrita
@enduml
